<section class="about-section scroll-reveal" aria-labelledby="profile-name">
  <header class="about-header">
    <h1 id="profile-name" class="hero-title"><span class="title-bold">Zhaolin</span> Wang</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-bio">
      <p>
        Welcome! I am a Research Assistant Professor in the Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering at <a href="https://www.hku.hk/">The University of Hong Kong (HKU)</a>. Prior to joining HKU in 2025, I was a Postdoctoral Research Assistant at <a href="https://www.qmul.ac.uk/">Queen Mary University of London (QMUL)</a>, where I also received my Ph.D. in 2024 under the supervision of <a href="https://www.eee.hku.hk/~yuanwei/">Prof. Yuanwei Liu</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        My research lies at the intersection of wireless communications, artificial intelligence, and electromagnetism.
      </p>

      <div class="about-contact">
        <p><span class="contact-label">Email:</span> <a class="contact-email" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
      </div>

      <ul class="profile-links" aria-label="Academic profiles">
